    "UIName": "Assassin ASN-SB",
    "Id": "mechdef_assassin_ASN-SB",
    "Name": "Assassin ASN-SB",
    "Details": "This variant replaces the standard Assassin's SRM-2 launcher and its ammunition with a second medium laser and extra armor concentrated on the legs. The technicians of the Hat-in-the-Ring Battalion, a long-serving Davion-allied mercenary unit, developed it as a routine field modification to fix two weaknesses of the original design. Dropping the jam-prone, ammunition-dependent short-range missiles leaves the LRM-5 as the only weapon that needs ammunition, and the heavier leg armor improves survival against the leg attacks common in light 'Mech fights. The simple conversion spread to other units with capable technicians.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_assassin"
  },
